cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EHItk, please cite the software version you used."
type: software
title: "EHItk: Earth Hologenome Initiative ToolKit"
version: "1.2.1"
date-released: 2026-06-28
abstract: >-
  EHItk is a Python package and command-line tool for finding, summarizing,
  exporting, and downloading Earth Hologenome Initiative specimens,
  hologenomes, and metagenome-assembled genomes.
authors:
